            <h2 class="section-title">Education Payroll in Mumbai - Overview</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - Education Payroll in Mumbai Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>Education payroll covers <strong>teacher salary per pay scales</strong> (7th CPC / UGC / AICTE / MEPS Act 1977), <strong>non-teaching + support staff</strong> (Maharashtra min wages), <strong>visiting faculty honoraria</strong> (TDS S.194J), <strong>PF/ESI</strong>, <strong>academic calendar</strong> (summer vacation, June/July increments), <strong>trust/society accounting</strong> with Charity Commissioner IX-C, and <strong>gratuity</strong>.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper" style="margin-top:16px;"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Governing Acts</td><td>MEPS Act 1977; UGC/AICTE 7th CPC; EPF/ESI Acts; Maharashtra PT; RTE Act 2009; Maharashtra Public Trusts Act 1950</td></tr><tr><td>Applicable To</td><td>CBSE/ICSE/SSC/IB schools, degree colleges, engineering colleges, coaching, EdTech, pre-schools</td></tr><tr><td>Timeline</td><td>Payroll by 7th; PF/ESI by 15th; TDS by 7th; increments June/July; IX-C within 6 months</td></tr><tr><td>Cost From</td><td>Rs 5,000/month (pre-school / small institution)</td></tr><tr><td>Key Challenge</td><td>Multiple pay scales, visiting faculty 194J, academic calendar, trust accounting, MEPS compliance</td></tr><tr><td>Authority</td><td>EPFO Mumbai; ESIC Mumbai; Maharashtra Education Dept; Charity Commissioner Mumbai</td></tr></tbody></table></div></p>
                </div>
                <p>Mumbai has thousands of schools and colleges: <strong>Andheri/Bandra</strong> school clusters, <strong>Churchgate/Fort</strong> legacy colleges, <strong>Powai</strong> (IIT/EdTech), <strong>Navi Mumbai</strong> new campuses. Each with diverse staff: 7th CPC professors, MEPS Act teachers, min-wage support, visiting faculty. Learn more about <a href="#">Education Payroll across India</a>.</p>
                <p>Patron's Marine Lines office handles education payroll with trust/society accounting integration. Also see <a href="/payroll-services">Payroll Services</a> and <a href="/ngo-accounting-services/mumbai">NGO Accounting in Mumbai</a>.</p>
                <p>Content is reviewed quarterly for accuracy.</p>
