                <p><strong>MEPS Act 1977:</strong> Maharashtra private school teacher conditions. Pay scales, leave (earned, casual, medical, maternity), PF, gratuity, retirement age, disciplinary procedure. Non-compliance: Education Dept + legal proceedings.</p><p><strong>UGC/AICTE 7th CPC:</strong> Professor Level 14, Assoc Prof 13A, Asst Prof Level 10 + AGP. DA revised. HRA per city (Mumbai X). Aided: govt salary grant. Unaided: own funds.</p><p><strong>PF/ESI:</strong> 20+ employees: PF 12%+12%, ECR by 15th. 10+ employees: ESI 3.25%+0.75% for ≤ Rs 21,000. Schools and colleges are covered establishments.</p><p><strong>Trust/Society:</strong> Maharashtra Public Trusts Act 1950: IX-C with Charity Commissioner. 12A/80G exemption. Section 8: RoC Mumbai. Society: Registrar annual filing.</p><p><strong>Portals:</strong> <a href="https://epfindia.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">EPFO</a> | <a href="https://esic.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ESIC</a> | <a href="https://charity.maharashtra.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Charity Commissioner</a> | <a href="https://ugc.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UGC</a></p>

