                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What payroll compliance applies to schools and colleges in Mumbai?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>PF (20+ employees, 12%+12%), ESI (10+, wages ≤ Rs 21,000), Maharashtra PT, TDS S.192 (staff) + S.194J (visiting faculty), Payment of Wages/Gratuity/Bonus Acts, MEPS Act 1977 (private schools). Trust schools additionally file with Charity Commissioner under Maharashtra Public Trusts Act 1950.</p></div>
